    old "(As expected of Tabitha. Her defenses are impenetrable. Now, what to do?){#ch21_s_174}"
    new "（さすが、タバサだ。鉄壁の守りすぎる。さて、どうしよう？）"

    old "(All right, time to change tactics. I'll tease her.){#ch21_s_175}"
    new "（よし、ここは作戦を変えよう。じらしてみるぞ）"

